    "chunk_text": "No. 2021 2022 2023 2024 2025\n\n1 United States\n\nof America\n\nUnited States\n\nof America\n\nUnited States\n\nof America\n\nUnited States\n\nof America\n\nUnited States\n\nof America\n\n2 Germany Netherlands Germany Germany Germany\n\n4 China Germany China China China\n\n5 United Kingdom\n\nUnited Kingdom\n\nUnited Kingdom\n\nUnited Kingdom\n\nUnited Kingdom\n\n6 Canada India India India India\n\n7 Japan Canada United Arab\n\nEmirates Canada Canada\n\n8 Australia Japan Canada United Arab\n\nEmirates\n\nUnited Arab\n\nEmirates\n\n9 India United Arab\n\nEmirates Mexico France France\n\n10 Mexico Australia Australia Mexico Australia\n\nYear 2021 2022 2023 2024 2025\n\nPercentage (%) 64 64 63 63 65\n\n1023 1024\n\n\u0db4\u0dc1\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dd2\u0daf\u0db8\u0dca\u0dca\u0dd4\u0dc0\n\n(including coconut seedling varieties, planting and maintenance of seedlings, intercropping and animal husbandry, smart agriculture, et cetera), as well as the organizational structure and corporate information, growers can download the information they need and directly contact the relevant extension officers.\n\n\u2022 Developing and promoting the\n\n\u2018Coco App\u2019 mobile application among the public\n\nThis mobile application, which has been developed to include all technical advice related to coconut cultivation, enables growers to access the knowledge they need at any time, and also provides updated information and facilitates the submission of field-related issues to extension officers through the application. This app can be downloaded on both Android and iPhone platforms.\n\n\u2022 Instant Information Service 1916 For the convenience of coconut growers across the Island, a trilingual hotline service has been established under 1916. This service provides advisory services for technical issues faced by coconut growers, as well as information on the services of the Coconut Cultivation Board.\n\n\u2022 \uf031\uf039\uf032\uf030 Hotline Service\n\nThrough the 1920 short code hotline, it is possible to obtain advice on issues related to coconut cultivation. Relevant information is provided by experienced technical officers in the field.\n\n\u2022 \uf043\uf06f\uf063\uf06f\uf06e\uf075\uf074 Fortnight (\u0daf\u0db4\u0dc1\u0dbd\u0dca \u0daf\u0daf\u0dc3\u0dd2 )\u200d"
