    "chunk_text": "Emergency, said, \u201cDeclare Emergency.\u201d That is the situation when you must declare Emergency, to deal with a situation that you cannot cope with unless you have the entire system mobilized including the armed forces. But, this is not a situation to declare Emergency. You are falsely trying to justify this and your brief - it is so pathetic - is exposed today and that is the reality.\n\nNow, take a good example of this situation. I think the senior Members in the Government know about this situation. There is an author called Theepachelvan Piratheepan. I think about 350 copies of two of his books - one book is called \u201cElluttal nan Yuttam Ceykiren\u201d and the other is called \u201cIppothum Inge Irandu Thesangalthaan.\u201d - which are two factual , non-fiction books have practically been banned by Sri Lanka Customs. The Sri Lanka Customs has written a letter saying that those two books have been banned on the recommendations by the Arts Council of Sri Lanka, the State Panel of Literature of the Ministry of Buddhasasana, Religious and Cultural Affairs and the Ministry of Defence. Sir, I table* that letter."
