    "chunk_size_bytes": 1810,
    "chunk_text": "\u0b85\u0ba4\u0ba9\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bbf\u0bb1\u0b95\u0bc1, \u0bc7\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc7\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b89\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bb2\u0bcd \u0b95\u0bbf\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0b9a\u0bbf\u0bb1\u0bbf \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd \u0b85\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bbf\u0bb0\u0bbe\u0b9a\u0ba9\u0ba4\u0bcd \u0ba4\u0bbf\u0ba9\u0bbf\u0ba9\u0bcd\u0bb1\u0bc1 \u0b85\u0b95\u0bb2\u0bae\u0bb5, \u0bc7\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bc7\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0b9a\u0baa\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bbe\u0baf\u0b95\u0bb0\u0bcd \u0b85\u0bb5\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd \u0ba4\u0b95\u0bb2\u0b95\u0bc7 \u0bb5\u0b95\u0bbf\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bbe\u0bb0\u0bcd\u0b95\u0bb3\u0bcd.\n\nWhereupon THE HON. UPUL KITHSIRI left the Chair, and THE HON. SPEAKER took the Chair.\n\nAlthough Members of the Opposition said that it was the ineptness of the Government and that it is not a justification to extend the Emergency Regulations, it is evidence of the effectiveness of the administration carried out by the Government, which is over 90 per cent. That is a very clear manifestation that justifies the extension of the Emergency Regulations because we want to complete the rest as well successfully.\n\nIt was also brought up by the Hon. Member from the Opposition that no reform in the security sector has taken place over the period of the last 15 or 16 months. We, the NPP Government, have very well exhibited how to bridge the gap between communities, doing away with the disharmony that has been prevailing over a period of many decades. It was very clearly shown at the May Day Rally in Jaffna led by our Hon. Minister and the Hon. Members of Parliament with a mass gathering of people, which you all could not do so far. That shows the pulse of the people embedded in the National People\u2019s Power.\n\nThe land issue has also been raised based on false information. I request the Hon. Member to attend the next Ministerial Consultative Committee on Defence presided over by the Hon. President. I am also to visit Jaffna and other areas of the North and East to consider all that information and to see how best we could release more land for the people in need."
  },
