    "chunk_text": "\u2022 Molkawa M.V. is situated 2 km away from the WP/Ho/Paragoda Kithulagoda Junior School. That school is operated from Grades 1-13, have the learning facilities up to the GCE (Advanced Level) Arts stream and is equipped with adequate physical resources.\n\n(v) \u2022 WP/Mathu/Molkawa Maha Vidyalaya can be identified as the nearest school to the WP/Ho/Paragoda Kithulagoda Junior School.\n\n(vi) Yes.\n\nParagoda Kithulagoda area is an area identified as a high flood risk area. Even though the roads, low-lying areas and houses around the school submerge in floodwater, the school does not submerge due to its geographical location. Even though the school does not submerge during floods, students are unable to reach the school due to submerged access roads. This school is already operating as a disaster relief centre currently in the Bulathsinhala Divisional Secretary's Division.\n\n(vii) Since the total number of students in this school remains at a very low level, the General Meeting of the School Development Society has decided to take necessary actions to increase the number of students.\n\n(viii) No decision has been taken to close this school, yet.\n\n(b) Not applicable.\n\n1777 1778\n\n\u0dc3\u0dd0.\u0dd4\u0dad.\n\n\u0dda \u0db8\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dc0\u0daf\u0dda\u0dc1\u0db8\u0d85\u0dcf\u0dc3\u0dca\u0daf\u0db1\u0db8\u0dd4\u0daf\u0daf\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dda\u0dba\u0db8\u0dc3\u0dca\u0dc4\u0dc4\u0daf\u0db8\u0dc3\u0dca\u0dad\u0dcf\u0d9a\u0dd3\u0dba\u0db8\u0dd2\u0dba\u0dcf\u0db4\u0dba\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0db8\u0dd9\u0dc5\u0db8\u0dd4\u0dad\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8\u0db8\u0dc0\u0db4\u0dca\u0db8\u0dbd\u0d9a\u0dca\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dd4\u0db8\u0db4\u0dad\u0dc3\u0dd2\u0db8 \u0dca\u0dd3\u0dca\u0db8\u0db8\u0dd2\u0dca\u0db8\u0db4\u0dd2\u0da7 \u0dba\u0dc0\u0d9a\u0dca\u0dc0\u0db8\u0dda\u0d9c\u0db1\u0db8\u0dd2\u0dba\u0dcf\u0db4\u0dba\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0db8\u0dd9\u0dc5\u0db8\u0dd4\u0dad\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8\u0db8\u0d86\u0dd9\u0daf\u0dba\u0dba\u0db8\u0d91\u0dc4\u0dd2\u0db8\