    "md5": "b6848ab50c360869a9836c0a0f1ec89a",
    "chunk_size_bytes": 2014,
    "chunk_text": "Thank you. \u0d9c\u0dd4\u0dab \u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0d9a\u0dd4\u0dab\u0dab\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dcf\u0dba\u0d9a \u0db8 \u0dad\u0dcf (\u0bae\u0bbe\u0ba3\u0bcd\u0baa\u0bc1\u0bae\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc1 \u0bb0\u0bb5\u0bbf \u0b95\u0bb0\u0bc1\u0ba3\u0bbe\u0ba8\u0bbe\u0baf\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95) (The Hon. Ravi Karunanayake) Hon. Speaker, I thank the Hon. Deputy Minister for giving a very comprehensive Answer. My cybersecurity knowledge is at infancy state compared to your knowledge, Hon. Deputy Minister. But still, on behalf of the country, there is a necessity to check on certain matters that are happening. Theoretically, you did explain, covering certain areas. And, I asked this Question on the 23rd of October, 2025 because there was an apparent cyber threat at that time.\n\nHon. Deputy Minister, The UN Global Dialogue on Artificial Intelligence Governance is scheduled for 06 and 07th July, 2026. I hope you or some one from your Ministry would attend that session because I am made to understand that this is the first time an international arm is looking into digital frauds that are going on and there are a lot of cyber attacks taking place in the world. So, I am sure you would look into that, Hon. Deputy Minister.\n\nIn your Answer, you did mention about three specific cyber attacks. One was in 2023. Then, the cyber attack on the Ministry of Finance happened just about two months ago. How do you basically reconcile what has been revealed and what has not been revealed? At the moment, it has been revealed is that about Rs. 80 billion had been siphoned, hacked or whacked, whatever the terminology that is used for that. How do you assess what has not been reported? Now, it is also said that US Dollars 600,000 had been paid to US Postal Service and that there are some other incidents involving French and Australian documents et cetera. So, I would appreciate if you would brief the House.\n\n2235 2236\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014 * \u0db4\u0dd4\u0dc4\u0db1\u0dad\u0d9a\u0dcf\u0dbd\u0db4\u0dda \u0dad\u0dbb\u0dcf \u0d87\u0dad. * \u0ba8\u0bc2\u0ba9\u0bbf\u0b95\u0bc8\u0baf\u0ba4\u0bcd\u0ba4\u0bbf\u0bb2\u0bcd \u0b95\u0bb5\u0b95\u0bcd\u0b95\u0baa\u0bcd\u0baa\u0b9f\u0bcd\u0b9f\u0bc1\u0bb3\u0bcd\u0bb3\u0ba4\u0bc1. * Placed in the Library.\n\n\u0db4\u0dab\u0dbb\u0dca\u0dae\u0dd2\u0dc3 \u0db1\u0dca\u0dad\u0dd4\u0db8\u0dc0"
